#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:1
msgid "Local accounts and the waiting list"
msgstr "本地账号与等候名单"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:3
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent can run with its own accounts instead of HybridInference "
"Gateway sign-in. Set `AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local` and people sign up with an "
"email address and a password, or with a phone number and a code, verify "
"the address, sign in, and apply for Agent use through a waiting list that"
" administrators review. Local accounts have every account feature "
"HybridInference has: login names, phone codes, several accounts in one "
"browser, changing the password and the email, deleting the account, a "
"sign-up policy, first-run setup, administrator mail and the rest (see the"
" [feature parity table](../agents/specs/2026-10-29-account-feature-parity"
".zh-CN.md)). Gateway mode remains the default, and nothing in this page "
"changes it."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 可以使用自己的账号体系，无需通过 HybridInference Gateway 登录。设置 "
"`AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local` 后，用户使用邮箱和密码、或手机号和验证码注册，验证邮箱并登录，再通过等候名单申请使用 "
"Agent，由管理员审核。本地账号具备 HybridInference "
"的全部账号功能：登录名、手机验证码、同一浏览器多账号、修改密码和邮箱、注销账号、注册策略、首次设置、管理员邮件等（见[功能对齐表](../agents/specs/2026-10-29"
"-account-feature-parity.zh-CN.md)）。默认仍为网关模式，本文不会改变这一默认值。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:14
msgid ""
"The design is [independent accounts and waiting "
"list](../agents/specs/2026-10-27-independent-accounts-and-waitlist-design"
".zh-CN.md). This page describes what is implemented."
msgstr ""
"设计见[独立账号与 waiting list](../agents/specs/2026-10-27-independent-accounts-"
"and-waitlist-design.zh-CN.md)。本文说明已实现的功能。"

