#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:29
msgid ""
"In local mode `app.state.gateway` is `LocalModeGateway` "
"(`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`). It has the methods the Gateway "
"client has. Identity and admission are answered from this database, and "
"each Gateway-only method is refused with a typed error, without a network"
" call. Every existing owner check therefore reads the local decision: "
"request admission, claims, goal rounds, waiting messages, team approval "
"and ownership transfer, the on-call service account, Profile and team "
"rosters. A local account ID never reaches the Gateway."
msgstr ""
"本地模式下，`app.state.gateway` 是 "
"`LocalModeGateway`（`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`）。它提供与网关客户端相同的方法。身份与准入从本服务的数据库读取；仅网关支持的方法直接返回带类型的错误，不发起网络请求。因此，所有现有的所有者检查都会读取本地准入决定，包括请求准入、认领、目标轮次、等待消息、团队审批与所有权转移、值班服务账号、Profile"
" 和团队成员名单。本地账号 ID 不会传到网关。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:38
msgid "Enabling it"
msgstr "启用本地模式"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:40
msgid ""
"Local mode needs its own database. At startup it binds an empty database "
"to local identity (`agent_local_identity_namespace`). It refuses a "
"database bound to a Gateway issuer, or one that holds owner data without "
"a binding. Gateway mode, in turn, refuses a database bound to local "
"identity. Both checks take the same table lock, so two listeners that "
"start in different modes cannot each bind the database. No setting skips "
"these checks. Moving an existing Gateway-bound database to local accounts"
" is a separate identity migration (phase A3 in the design), and it is not"
" implemented."
msgstr ""
"本地模式需要独立数据库。启动时会把空数据库绑定到本地身份（`agent_local_identity_namespace`）。数据库若已绑定网关签发方，或虽未绑定却已有所有者数据，启动就会被拒绝。反过来，网关模式也会拒绝已绑定本地身份的数据库。两项检查持有同一把表锁，所以两个监听器即使以不同模式同时启动，也不能分别绑定同一数据库。没有配置项可以跳过这些检查。把已绑定网关的数据库转为本地账号，需要单独实施身份迁移，即设计中的"
" A3 阶段，目前尚未实现。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local`"
msgstr "`AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Selects local accounts. Set it on both listeners."
msgstr "选择本地账号模式。两个监听器都要设置。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"At least 32 random bytes, different from `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`. Keys the"
" stored hashes of sessions, emailed tokens and abuse counters."
msgstr "至少 32 个随机字节，且与 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 不同。作为密钥，用于计算并存储会话、邮件令牌和防滥用计数器的哈希。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Required at local-mode startup. Encrypts personal model keys and other "
"stored credentials in separate domains."
msgstr "本地模式启动时必填。使用不同加密域保存个人模型密钥及其他凭据。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED=true`"
msgstr "`AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED=true`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Enables personal model setup and new turns. Local mode respects this "
"explicit rollout gate; leaving it off does not enable shared inference."
msgstr "启用个人模型配置及新轮次。本地模式同样遵守这个显式发布开关；保持关闭不会启用共享推理。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The only base used for emailed links. A request's `Host` is never used."
msgstr "邮件链接只使用这个基地址，不使用请求中的 `Host`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:57
msgid ""
"Everything else is in **Admin → Settings → Accounts**, saved in the "
"database and imported once from its environment variable (see "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)): public sign-up, whether a new "
"email must be verified, the approval policy (`manual`, or `domains` with "
"the signup domain list), administrator notices and their recipients, "
"administrator email addresses promoted at sign-in, the Terms of Service "
"link or text, the session lifetime, the sign-in and sign-up limits "
"(including sign-ups whose client address cannot be told), the email "
"transport (SMTP, Tencent SES or a registered one), phone sign-in and its "
"Tencent SMS provider, and Turnstile. Secrets are encrypted and never "
"shown again. Without mail, email sign-up is closed while verification is "
"required, and recovery answers 503; with verification turned off, sign-up"
" works without SMTP."
msgstr ""
"其余设置都在 **管理 → 设置 → 账号** 中，保存在数据库里，并从对应的环境变量导入一次（见 "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)）：公开注册、新邮箱是否必须验证、审批策略（`manual`，或配合注册域名名单的"
" "
"`domains`）、管理员通知及其收件人、登录时提升为管理员的管理员邮箱地址、服务条款链接或正文、会话有效期、登录和注册限制（包括无法识别客户端地址的注册）、邮件传输方式（SMTP、腾讯云"
" SES 或已注册的传输方式）、手机登录及其腾讯云短信服务商，以及 "
"Turnstile。密钥加密保存，保存后不再显示。没有邮件服务时，在要求验证的情况下邮箱注册关闭，账号恢复返回 503；关闭验证后，没有 SMTP"
" 也能注册。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:70
msgid ""
"The web server must reach the same control plane "
"(`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`). The web app reads `GET /v1/auth/config` to "
"choose its sign-in pages and `GET /v1/auth/options` for what they offer."
msgstr ""
"Web 服务器必须能访问同一控制平面（`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`）。Web 应用读取 `GET "
"/v1/auth/config` 来选择登录页面，读取 `GET /v1/auth/options` 了解这些页面提供哪些功能。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:74
msgid "Hosts without a Gateway"
msgstr "不依赖 Gateway 的主机"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:76
msgid ""
"Set `AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local` in each host's deployment environment as well"
" as the control plane. Keep `AGENT_GATEWAY_URL` empty. The supported "
"`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` recipe removes the unused inference tunnel "
"before Compose resolves required settings; it needs no Gateway SSH "
"address, key or health check. Source deployments need Python with PyYAML "
"to render this recipe; artifact deployments use their deployment Python "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"除了控制面，还应在每台主机的部署环境中设置 `AGENT_AUTH_MODE=local`，并将 `AGENT_GATEWAY_URL` "
"留空。支持的 `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` 配方会在 Compose "
"解析必填设置之前移除不再使用的推理隧道，因此无需 Gateway SSH 地址、密钥或健康检查。源码部署需要安装 PyYAML 的 Python "
"来生成该配方；构件部署使用已有的部署 Python 环境。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:83
msgid ""
"The host still requires the control-plane and MCP tunnels and their "
"separate credentials. Personal model calls use the existing public HTTPS "
"egress. No sandbox gains access to the management API, private networks "
"or another group. Gateway-mode hosts retain their inference relay and its"
" checks; an empty URL never turns a Gateway host into a local one."
msgstr ""
"主机仍需要控制面与 MCP 隧道及各自的凭据。个人模型调用使用现有的公共 HTTPS 出站通道，不会让沙箱获得管理 "
"API、私网或其他沙箱组的访问权限。Gateway 模式主机保留推理中继及其检查；空 URL 不会将 Gateway 主机自动改为本地主机。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:89
msgid ""
"In **Servers → deployment setup**, local administrators enter only the "
"control-plane machine. Setup derives the host mode from the control "
"plane, omits Gateway provisioning, and discards stale Gateway form "
"values. Gateway deployments still require the Gateway machine. A manually"
" supplied managed host profile must agree with the control plane's mode."
msgstr ""
"在 **Servers → deployment setup** 中，本地管理员只需填写控制面机器。配置流程从控制面确定主机模式，省略 "
"Gateway 配置，并丢弃表单中残留的旧 Gateway 值。Gateway 部署仍需要 Gateway "
"机器。手动提供的托管主机配置必须与控制面模式一致。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:95
msgid "The first administrator"
msgstr "首位管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:97
msgid ""
"The first account to sign up gets nothing. While the deployment has no "
"administrator, every control-plane process logs a one-time setup code at "
"startup (`agent_local_setup_pending`, at WARNING). At "
"**/setup/administrator** the operator exchanges it for an administrator "
"that signs in with a login name and needs no email or SMTP; wrong codes "
"are limited to 10 per address in 15 minutes, and of two requests with the"
" right code exactly one succeeds. An administrator made any other way "
"closes setup too."
msgstr ""
"第一个注册的账号不会获得任何权限。部署还没有管理员时，每个控制平面进程在启动时记录一次性设置码（`agent_local_setup_pending`，WARNING"
" 级别）。运维人员在 **/setup/administrator** 用它换取一个使用登录名登录、不需要邮箱或 SMTP "
"的管理员；错误的设置码每个地址每 15 分钟最多 10 次，两个携带正确设置码的请求只有一个会成功。以其他方式创建的管理员同样会关闭首次设置。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:105
msgid ""
"Someone who holds the deployment's database credential and local secret "
"can also work from the command line, without mail. The password is read "
"from standard input or a terminal prompt, never from the command line:"
msgstr "持有部署数据库凭据和本地密钥的人也可以在命令行中操作，无需邮件。密码从标准输入或终端提示中读取，绝不出现在命令行上："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:116
msgid ""
"`--create-*` makes a verified, approved account, an administrator unless "
"`--member`. An existing account must have a verified sign-in identity; "
"`--approve` also approves its Agent application, because administration "
"is granted only to an approved account. Each step goes through the same "
"audited, versioned action the administration API uses, with the actor "
"`deployment-bootstrap`."
msgstr ""
"`--create-*` 创建一个已验证、已批准的账号，除非指定 "
"`--member`，否则是管理员。已有账号必须拥有已验证的登录身份；`--approve` 还会批准该账号的 Agent "
"使用申请，因为只有获批账号才能获得管理权限。每一步都使用与管理 API 相同的操作，执行版本校验并记录审计，操作者记为 `deployment-"
"bootstrap`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:123
msgid ""
"An account whose **proven** email is one of the **administrator email "
"addresses** setting is approved and made an administrator when it signs "
"in, as HybridInference's `ADMIN_EMAILS` does. Proven means a link sent to"
" the address was followed (verification, an address change or a password "
"reset) or the operator created the account. An address accepted while "
"email verification is off is not proven, so listing one does not hand the"
" console to whoever signs up with it first; its holder proves it with a "
"password reset. The list stays in charge: withdrawing a listed account's "
"administration or access, or declining it, is refused with 409 "
"`listed_admin_address` until the address is removed from the list (or the"
" account is suspended), because the next sign-in would grant it back."
msgstr ""
"如果账号的**已证明**邮箱在**管理员邮箱地址**设置中，它在登录时会被批准并设为管理员，与 HybridInference 的 "
"`ADMIN_EMAILS` "
"相同。已证明是指点击过发送到该地址的链接（验证、修改邮箱或重置密码），或账号由运维人员创建。关闭邮箱验证期间接受的地址不算已证明，因此把某个地址列入名单，不会把控制台交给第一个用它注册的人；地址的真正持有者通过重置密码来证明。名单始终优先：只要地址仍在名单中，撤销该账号的管理权限或使用权限、或拒绝其申请，都会以"
" 409 `listed_admin_address` 拒绝，直到地址从名单中移除（或账号被停用），因为下次登录会重新授予。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:135
msgid "The HTTP surface"
msgstr "HTTP 接口"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:137
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Errors use the usual envelope, `{\"detail\": {\"error\": {\"type\", "
"\"message\"}}}`. Every response is `no-store`. A refused body is reported"
" by field and rule only, so a 422 never repeats a password or a token."
msgstr ""
"错误沿用现有格式：`{\"detail\": {\"error\": {\"type\", \"message\"}}}`。所有响应均为 `no-"
"store`。请求体校验失败时，只报告字段和规则，因此 422 响应不会回显密码或令牌。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET /v1/auth/config`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/auth/config`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{mode, signup_enabled}`. Public, in both modes."
msgstr "`{mode, signup_enabled}`。两种模式下都公开可读。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET /v1/auth/options`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/auth/options`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"What the account pages offer: email and phone sign-up, mail delivery, "
"phone policy, Turnstile site key, Terms, whether setup is pending, "
"browser limit. Reads only."
msgstr "账号页面提供的功能：邮箱和手机注册、邮件发送、手机策略、Turnstile site key、服务条款、是否待首次设置、浏览器账号上限。只读。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/auth/signup`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/auth/signup`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{email, password, user_name?, use_case?, accepted_tos, "
"turnstile_token?}`; `{ok: true}` for every address. The Terms must be "
"accepted and the captcha (when configured) must verify; disposable and "
"reserved domains are refused. A registered address gets a password-reset "
"link, not a second account, and its password is not changed. A `use_case`"
" submits the Agent application with the sign-up."
msgstr ""
"`{email, password, user_name?, use_case?, accepted_tos, "
"turnstile_token?}`；对任何地址都返回 `{ok: true}`。必须接受服务条款，配置了 captcha "
"时必须通过验证；一次性邮箱和保留域名会被拒绝。已注册的地址会收到重置密码链接，而不是第二个账号，其密码也不会改变。提供 `use_case` "
"时，注册同时提交 Agent 使用申请。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/auth/login`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/auth/login`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{email, password}`, where `email` may also be a login name. Adds the "
"account to this browser, sets the cookie and returns the session body. "
"`invalid_credentials` for an unknown identifier and for a wrong password "
"alike. `account_deleted`, `account_suspended` (with the administrator's "
"message) and `email_not_verified`, in that order, only after the right "
"password. `browser_full` past five accounts."
msgstr ""
"`{email, password}`，其中 `email` 也可以是登录名。把账号加入当前浏览器，设置 cookie "
"并返回会话内容。未知标识和错误密码同样返回 `invalid_credentials`。只有在密码正确之后，才依次返回 "
"`account_deleted`、`account_suspended`（附管理员的说明）和 "
"`email_not_verified`。超过五个账号时返回 `browser_full`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/auth/phone/code`, `/phone/signup`, `/phone/login`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"A six-digit code bound to its purpose (`signup`, `login`, `bind`, "
"`delete_account`, `bind_email`, `set_password`), number and account; the "
"same answer for every number. Every code request carries a Turnstile "
"token when one is configured, and each token is good for one request."
msgstr ""
"六位验证码，与用途（`signup`、`login`、`bind`、`delete_account`、`bind_email`、`set_password`）、号码和账号绑定；对任何号码的回答都相同。配置了"
" Turnstile 时，每次请求验证码都要附带 token，每个 token 只能用于一次请求。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/auth/verify-email`, `/resend-verification`, `/forgot-password`,"
" `/reset-password`"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/auth/verify-email`, `/resend-verification`, `/forgot-password`,"
" `/reset-password`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{ok: true}`. Tokens are single-use and expire (24 hours to verify or "
"bind, 1 hour to reset); a newer token replaces older ones, and a used one"
" is refused. A reset verifies the email and ends every session of the "
"account."
msgstr ""
"`{ok: true}`。令牌只能使用一次，并有有效期（验证或绑定 24 小时，重置 1 "
"小时）；新令牌替换旧令牌，已使用的令牌会被拒绝。重置密码也会验证邮箱，并结束该账号的所有会话。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/auth/accounts`, `POST /v1/auth/switch`, `DELETE "
"/v1/auth/accounts/{id}`, `POST /v1/auth/logout-all`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"The accounts signed in on this browser: list, switch, sign one out, sign "
"all out."
msgstr "当前浏览器上已登录的账号：列出、切换、退出其中一个、全部退出。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/auth/account`, `POST /v1/auth/account/password`, `/email`, "
"`/phone`, `/delete`, `PUT /v1/auth/account/locale`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"The signed-in account's own changes; see [The owner's own changes](#the-"
"owners-own-changes)."
msgstr "已登录账号本人的修改；见[本人的修改](#the-owners-own-changes)。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/auth/setup/admin`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/auth/setup/admin`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "First-run setup."
msgstr "首次设置。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET /v1/session/me`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/session/me`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Adds `auth_mode`, `email`, `waitlist`, `identity` and `is_local_admin` "
"for a local account. The Gateway-mode body is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"为本地账号增加 `auth_mode`、`email`、`waitlist`、`identity` 和 "
"`is_local_admin`。网关模式的响应体保持不变。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`POST /v1/session/logout`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/session/logout`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Signs the browser's active account out; the cookie goes with its last "
"account."
msgstr "让浏览器当前使用的账号退出登录；最后一个账号退出时 cookie 一并失效。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET`/`POST /v1/waitlist`"
msgstr "`GET`/`POST /v1/waitlist`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Needs a verified, signed-in account only. Submitting again while pending "
"changes nothing. A rejected or revoked application is submitted again "
"only when its owner asks."
msgstr "只要求账号已验证邮箱并已登录。待审批时再次提交不会改变状态。申请被拒绝或准入被撤销后，只有所有者主动操作才会重新提交。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`GET /v1/admin/accounts`"
msgstr "`GET /v1/admin/accounts`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`q` (email, login name, phone or name anywhere, or an id prefix), "
"`status`, `account_status`, `sort` (`created` or `last_login`); the "
"answer has counts per state."
msgstr ""
"`q`（在邮箱、登录名、手机号或姓名中任意位置匹配，或按 id "
"前缀）、`status`、`account_status`、`sort`（`created` 或 "
"`last_login`）；响应包含各状态的数量。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /v1/admin/accounts/{id}`"
msgstr "`PATCH /v1/admin/accounts/{id}`"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`approve`, `reject`, `revoke`, `suspend`, `restore`, `grant_admin`, "
"`revoke_admin`, `delete`, `resume`, at `expected_version`. Approval and "
"rejection are mailed to the account. Withdrawing what the administrator "
"address list grants back is refused (`listed_admin_address`)."
msgstr ""
"按 `expected_version` 执行 "
"`approve`、`reject`、`revoke`、`suspend`、`restore`、`grant_admin`、`revoke_admin`、`delete`、`resume`。批准和拒绝会以邮件通知账号。管理员邮箱名单会重新授予的撤销操作会被拒绝（`listed_admin_address`）。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`PATCH /v1/admin/accounts/{id}/notes`, `GET /{id}/login-events`, `POST "
"/{id}/erase`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"The private note and suspension message, sign-in history, permanent "
"erasure."
msgstr "私密备注和停用说明、登录记录、彻底擦除。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/admin/accounts/{id}/teams`, `POST /{id}/teams/{team}/transfer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"The teams a deleted account owns, and handing one to a member before "
"erasure."
msgstr "已删除账号拥有的团队，以及在擦除前把团队移交给某个成员。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"`GET`/`POST`/`DELETE /v1/admin/accounts/signup-domains`, `DELETE "
"/v1/admin/accounts/login-events`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "The signup domain list; purging sign-in events by age or by account."
msgstr "注册域名名单；按时间或按账号清除登录事件。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "`/v1/admin/account-mail`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Mail to accounts: `POST /preview` (with `delivery_problem`), `POST "
"/test`, create, list, detail, cancel, each list paged."
msgstr ""
"发送邮件给账号：`POST /preview`（含 `delivery_problem`）、`POST "
"/test`、创建、列表、详情、取消，列表均分页。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:162
msgid ""
"Mail links point at the web app's `/verify-email#token=…` and `/reset-"
"password#token=…`. A browser never sends the fragment to a server, so the"
" token stays out of access logs. The page sends the token in an explicit "
"POST, and following a link changes nothing by itself."
msgstr ""
"邮件链接指向 Web 应用的 `/verify-email#token=…` 和 `/reset-password#token=…`。浏览器不会把"
" URL 片段发送给服务器，因此令牌不会进入访问日志。页面通过显式 POST 请求发送令牌，仅打开链接不会改变任何状态。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:167
msgid ""
"Each unsafe `/v1/auth/*` request is checked by the cross-site write "
"guard, whether or not it carries a cookie, and the body must be JSON. A "
"cross-site sign-in would otherwise put an attacker's account in the "
"victim's browser."
msgstr ""
"所有会改变状态的 `/v1/auth/*` 请求，无论是否携带 cookie，都要经过跨站写入保护检查，且请求体必须是 "
"JSON。否则，跨站登录可能把攻击者的账号登录到受害者的浏览器中。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:173
msgid ""
"An account is who signs in. Its admission is whether that person may use "
"Agent. These are separate records:"
msgstr "账号说明登录者是谁，准入决定此人能否使用 Agent。两者分别记录："

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:176
msgid ""
"An identity is **verified** when the account has no unverified email and "
"at least one verified sign-in identity: a confirmed email, a login name "
"(made by the operator, so verified by construction) or a phone number "
"confirmed by a code. Each identity records what verified it "
"(`verified_by`): `link`, `code`, `operator`, or `policy` for an email "
"accepted unproven because verification is off. Only `link` and `operator`"
" prove a mailbox, which the administrator address list and the signup "
"domain list require. A password reset that proves a `policy` email is its"
" holder taking the account back: whatever the first claimant wrote "
"(display name, language, Terms acceptance, application text) is cleared, "
"a pending application returns to not applied, and the reclaim is audited;"
" administrators' decisions and the sign-in history stay. One database "
"view, `agent_local_account_access`, answers whether an account's identity"
" is verified, whether it may sign in and whether it may use Agent; every "
"SQL gate reads it, and it is built so that an account missing a row has "
"no access."
msgstr ""
"当账号没有未验证的邮箱、且至少有一个已验证的登录身份时，其身份为**已验证**：已确认的邮箱、登录名（由运维人员创建，因此天然已验证），或通过验证码确认的手机号。每个身份都记录它是如何被验证的（`verified_by`）：`link`、`code`、`operator`，或者在关闭验证时被接受、未经证明的邮箱记为"
" `policy`。只有 `link` 和 `operator` 能证明邮箱归属，管理员邮箱名单和注册域名名单都要求这一点。证明了 "
"`policy` "
"邮箱的重置密码，相当于地址持有者收回账号：先注册者写下的内容（显示名称、语言、服务条款确认、申请说明）会被清除，待审核的申请恢复为未申请，并记录审计；管理员已作出的决定和登录记录保留。一个数据库视图"
" `agent_local_account_access` 回答账号身份是否已验证、能否登录、能否使用 Agent；所有 SQL "
"闸门都读取它，并且缺少任何一行的账号都没有访问权限。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Account and admission"
msgstr "账号与准入状态"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Signs in, reads the application"
msgstr "登录并查看申请"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Owner routes, tasks, terminals, MCP"
msgstr "所有者路由、任务、终端、MCP"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Identity unverified"
msgstr "身份未验证"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verification and recovery only"
msgstr "仅验证与账号恢复流程"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, not applied or pending"
msgstr "已验证，未申请或待审批"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, approved"
msgstr "已验证，已获批"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes, with ownership checks"
msgstr "是，仍检查所有权"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Verified, rejected or revoked"
msgstr "已验证，申请被拒绝或准入被撤销"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Yes, with the reason"
msgstr "是，并显示原因"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Approved and marked administrator"
msgstr "已获批且标记为管理员"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Suspended"
msgstr "账号已停用"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No; every session is revoked"
msgstr "否；所有会话均被撤销"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Deleted"
msgstr "已删除"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "No; off every browser, every session and link ended"
msgstr "否；从所有浏览器移除，所有会话和链接失效"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:201
msgid ""
"With the `domains` approval policy an account whose proven email domain "
"is on the signup domain list (exactly, or as a subdomain of a `*.` entry)"
" is approved, audited as `signup-policy`, as soon as its identity is "
"verified; with an empty list every verified account is. A phone account "
"has no domain, so it is approved automatically only while the list is "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"在 `domains` 审批策略下，已证明邮箱的域名在注册域名名单中（完全匹配，或是 `*.` "
"条目的子域名）的账号，会在其身份验证后立即被批准，审计记为 `signup-"
"policy`；名单为空时，所有已验证账号都会被批准。手机账号没有域名，因此只有在名单为空时才会被自动批准。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:207
msgid ""
"`agent.use` needs a verified, active, approved account. `agent.admin` "
"also needs the explicit administrator flag; the flag alone grants "
"nothing. Granting administration never approves an account. Suspension "
"revokes the account's sessions, clears the administrator flag and turns "
"an approval into a revocation. Restoring an account lets it sign in and "
"apply again, and grants nothing back. An administrator cannot suspend "
"themself or remove their own access; the `ADMIN_TOKEN` can."
msgstr ""
"`agent.use` 要求账号已验证邮箱、处于有效状态且已获批。`agent.admin` "
"还要求显式管理员标记；只有这个标记并不授予任何权限。授予管理权限不会自动批准账号。停用账号会撤销其会话、清除管理员标记，并将已批准的准入改为撤销。恢复账号后可以重新登录和申请，但不会恢复任何权限。管理员不能停用自己或移除自己的准入权限；`ADMIN_TOKEN`"
" 可以执行这些操作。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:215
msgid ""
"Every account or admission change increments the account's `version`, "
"which is `WaitlistEntry.version`. An administrator action names the "
"version it read and is refused with 409 `version_conflict` when the "
"account has changed since. The change and its `agent_admin_audit_log` row"
" commit in one transaction. The audit row records the states, the version"
" and whether a reason was given; it never records an email address, "
"password, hash or token. The acting administrator's own permission is "
"checked again inside that transaction, so an administrator who is "
"suspended while a request is in flight changes nothing "
"(`actor_not_admin`)."
msgstr ""
"每次账号或准入变化都会递增账号的 `version`，也就是 "
"`WaitlistEntry.version`。管理员操作需要指明读取时的版本；如果账号此后已变更，则返回 409 "
"`version_conflict`。变更与对应的 `agent_admin_audit_log` "
"记录在同一事务中提交。审计记录保存状态、版本以及是否填写原因，不记录邮箱、密码、哈希或令牌。该事务内还会再次检查操作者本人的管理权限，所以请求执行期间若管理员被停用，该请求不会更改任何数据，并返回"
" `actor_not_admin`。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:225
msgid "Sessions and credentials"
msgstr "会话与凭据"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:227
msgid ""
"The cookie names a **browser**, which holds up to five signed-in "
"accounts, each through its own session row, and which one is active. "
"Every sign-in rotates the cookie's value. Switching needs no password "
"while the chosen account's own session lasts. Every request of the web "
"app names the account its tab shows (`X-Agent-Account`; streams use "
"`agent_account`); once the browser's active account is another, the "
"request is refused with 409 `account_switched` and the tab reloads, so a "
"tab left on one account never acts as the next one. An open stream re-"
"checks every 30 s and ends once the cookie no longer resolves to its "
"account."
msgstr ""
"cookie 指向一个**浏览器**，它最多持有五个已登录账号，每个账号都有自己的会话行，并记录当前使用哪一个。每次登录都会更换 cookie "
"的值。在所选账号自己的会话有效期内，切换无需密码。Web 应用的每个请求都会注明当前标签页显示的账号（`X-Agent-"
"Account`；流式请求使用 `agent_account`）；一旦浏览器当前账号变成另一个，请求会以 409 "
"`account_switched` 拒绝，标签页随之重新加载，因此停留在某个账号上的标签页永远不会以下一个账号的身份操作。已打开的流每 30 "
"秒复核一次，cookie 不再对应其账号时结束。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:236
msgid ""
"A browser that signed in to an account before is recognized by a signed "
"device cookie (`__Host-cloud_agent_device`, keyed from the local secret) "
"and counted in a sign-in window of its own, so others guessing the "
"account's password from the same address cannot lock it out there."
msgstr ""
"曾经登录过某账号的浏览器通过签名的设备 cookie（`__Host-"
"cloud_agent_device`，密钥来自本地密钥）识别，并单独计入一个登录窗口，因此从同一地址猜测该账号密码的他人无法在这里把账号锁住。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:240
msgid ""
"Passwords use HybridInference's Argon2id parameters and rules (see "
"[Reused code](#reused-code)). Hashing runs on a pool of four threads; at "
"most 64 hashes may wait, and beyond that a request is refused with 503 "
"instead of being queued."
msgstr ""
"密码使用 HybridInference 的 Argon2id 参数与规则，见[复用代码](#reused-"
"code)。哈希计算使用四个线程的线程池，最多允许 64 次哈希计算排队；超出时请求返回 503，不再入队。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:244
msgid ""
"A session value is `cals1.` followed by 256 random bits. The database "
"keeps only an HMAC of it, keyed from `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`. A "
"Gateway-mode cookie or JWT is never read in local mode."
msgstr ""
"会话值由 `cals1.` 前缀和 256 个随机位组成。数据库只保存以 `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` 为密钥计算的 "
"HMAC。本地模式不读取网关模式的 cookie 或 JWT。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:247
msgid ""
"A session lasts 30 days by default (`accounts.session_ttl_days`) and is "
"never extended. Sign-out, a password change or reset, a suspension and a "
"deletion revoke it."
msgstr "会话默认有效 30 天（`accounts.session_ttl_days`），不会续期。退出登录、修改或重置密码、停用和删除都会撤销会话。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:250
msgid ""
"Opening a session takes a lock on the account row before it reads the "
"password, so a session cannot be opened with a password that a concurrent"
" reset has replaced, or for an account that a concurrent suspension has "
"suspended."
msgstr "创建会话时，先锁定账号行，再读取密码。因此，并发重置已经替换的旧密码无法用于创建会话，并发停用的账号也无法创建会话。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:254
msgid ""
"Abuse limits are fixed-window counters in Postgres, so every worker and "
"replica shares them. Their keys are keyed hashes, by the normalized "
"identifier. Sign-in allows 5 attempts per identifier and address and 50 "
"per identifier in 15 minutes, counting only attempts the per-address "
"windows let through, and 20 per address in an hour; all three are "
"settings. Sign-up allows 5 per address in an hour and 10 in a day, or one"
" shared budget for sign-ups whose address cannot be told. Mail allows 3 "
"per email in an hour, 10 per email in a day and 10 per address in an "
"hour. Token redemption allows 30 per address in 15 minutes. Phone codes, "
"by default and each a setting: one every 60 s per number, 5 an hour and "
"10 a day per number, 20 an hour and 100 a day per address, 5 checks per "
"code, and check windows per number and per address."
msgstr ""
"防滥用限制使用 Postgres 中的固定窗口计数器，所有 worker "
"和副本共享同一组计数，计数器键是按规范化标识计算的带密钥哈希。登录限制为：每 15 分钟每个标识与地址组合最多 5 次、每个标识最多 50 "
"次（只计入通过了按地址窗口的尝试），每小时每个地址最多 20 次；这三项都可以设置。注册限制为每个地址每小时 5 次、每天 10 "
"次，无法识别地址的注册共享一份额度。邮件限制为每个邮箱每小时 3 次、每天 10 次，每个地址每小时 10 次。令牌兑换限制为每个地址每 15 "
"分钟 30 次。手机验证码默认如下，每项都可设置：每个号码每 60 秒一条，每个号码每小时 5 条、每天 10 条，每个地址每小时 20 条、每天"
" 100 条，每个验证码最多校验 5 次，并有按号码和按地址的校验窗口。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:266
msgid ""
"A hash cancelled while it runs keeps its slot in the pool until it ends. "
"Two sign-ins racing to upgrade an outdated hash both succeed: the one "
"whose compare-and-swap loses re-reads the winner's hash."
msgstr "运行中被取消的哈希计算会占用池中的名额直到结束。两个同时升级过时哈希的登录都会成功：比较并交换失败的一方会重新读取胜出方写入的哈希。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:269
msgid "Neither a recipient address nor a link is written to a log."
msgstr "日志既不记录收件地址，也不记录链接。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:271
msgid "The owner's own changes"
msgstr "本人的修改"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:273
msgid ""
"Each change is proven again the way the account signs in: its current "
"password, counted against the sign-in limits (with the device window), or"
" for an account without one a code sent to its own verified phone."
msgstr "每次修改都要按账号的登录方式重新证明身份：当前密码（计入登录限制，含设备窗口），或者对没有密码的账号，发送到其本人已验证手机的验证码。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:277
msgid ""
"**Password**: change it, or give a phone account its first one. Every "
"other session ends, open reset links stop working, and a verified email "
"is told."
msgstr "**密码**：修改密码，或为手机账号设置第一个密码。其他会话全部结束，未使用的重置链接失效，并通知已验证的邮箱。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:279
msgid ""
"**Email**: a link goes to the new address, which becomes the account's "
"only when it is followed; the old address is told and its reset links "
"stop working. Whether the address is taken is answered only after the "
"proof."
msgstr "**邮箱**：链接发送到新地址，点击后才成为账号的邮箱；旧地址会收到通知，其重置链接失效。地址是否已被占用，只在证明身份之后才回答。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:282
msgid ""
"**Phone**: bind a number proven by a code to an account that has none. As"
" in HybridInference, a bound number is not removed or replaced."
msgstr "**手机**：为没有手机号的账号绑定一个经验证码证明的号码。与 HybridInference 相同，已绑定的号码不能移除或更换。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:284
msgid ""
"**Delete**: type the account's identifier, give the proof. An "
"administrator cannot delete itself. The account is soft-deleted (below)."
msgstr "**删除**：输入账号标识并提供证明。管理员不能删除自己。账号被软删除（见下文）。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:286
msgid ""
"**Language**: kept with the account; the most recent choice wins, "
"including one made on this browser while signed out, which is carried "
"into the account with its time at the next sign-in."
msgstr "**语言**：随账号保存，以最近一次选择为准，包括在当前浏览器未登录时作出的选择，它会在下次登录时连同选择时间一起写入账号。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:290
msgid "Deleting and erasing"
msgstr "删除与擦除"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:292
msgid ""
"Deleting an account (by its owner or an administrator) marks it `deleted`"
" in one transaction with: every session revoked, the account taken off "
"every browser, open links and phone codes ended, approved access turned "
"into a revocation, an audit row, and a termination record of action "
"`delete`, which stops its work as below. Its data stays. An administrator"
" may **resume** it once that cleanup is acknowledged: it signs in again, "
"without Agent access."
msgstr ""
"删除账号（由本人或管理员）会在一个事务中把它标记为 "
"`deleted`，同时：撤销所有会话，从所有浏览器移除该账号，未使用的链接和手机验证码失效，已批准的权限变为撤销，写入审计记录，并创建一条操作为"
" `delete` 的终止记录，按下文所述停止其工作。数据保留。清理确认完成后，管理员可以**恢复**它：账号可以重新登录，但没有 Agent "
"权限。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:299
msgid ""
"An administrator may then **erase** it, typing its id to confirm. Erasure"
" is refused (`erase_blocked`) until the account is deleted, its "
"termination acknowledged, no turn of it queued, running or resident, and "
"every sandbox it owns deleted through the sandbox deletion path. It is "
"also refused while a host still has to clean up one of the account's "
"environment runs (`host_cleanup_pending`, naming the runs and hosts): a "
"host learns what to clean only from those rows, so they stay until it "
"reports them clean, which an offline host does when it reconnects."
msgstr ""
"之后管理员可以**擦除**它，需要输入账号 id "
"确认。以下条件未满足时擦除会被拒绝（`erase_blocked`）：账号已删除、终止已确认、没有排队、运行中或驻留的轮次，且它拥有的每个沙箱都已通过沙箱删除流程删除。只要还有主机需要清理该账号的环境运行，擦除也会被拒绝（`host_cleanup_pending`，并列出这些运行和主机）：主机只能从这些记录得知要清理什么，因此它们会保留到主机报告清理完成为止，离线的主机会在重新连接时完成。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:308
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Teams** are shared, so erasure settles them first. A team the account "
"owns alone is deleted, as its owner would delete it. A team other members"
" still use refuses the erasure (`team_transfer_required`, naming each "
"team); the account's review panel lists those teams with their members, "
"and an administrator hands each to one of them, as the owner's own "
"ownership transfer would (`GET /v1/admin/accounts/{id}/teams`, `POST "
".../teams/{team}/transfer`; only for a deleted account). Invitations the "
"account issued are revoked, and a team environment it made stays with its"
" team, recorded as the team owner's."
msgstr ""
"**团队**是共享的，因此擦除会先处理团队。账号独自拥有的团队会像 owner "
"自己删除那样被删除。其他成员仍在使用的团队会使擦除被拒绝（`team_transfer_required`，并逐一列出团队）；账号的审核面板会列出这些团队及其成员，管理员可以像"
" owner 自己转让那样把每个团队交给其中一名成员（`GET /v1/admin/accounts/{id}/teams`、`POST "
".../teams/{team}/transfer`；仅限已删除的账号）。账号发出的邀请会被撤销，它创建的团队环境留在团队中，记在团队 owner"
" 名下。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:318
msgid ""
"Erasure then removes every row of the account's Agent data, walking the "
"foreign keys from the catalog (children first), and never touches another"
" owner's row: a row of another owner that refers to the account's data "
"blocks the erasure. Its identifiers, password, sessions, tokens, codes, "
"sign-in events, mail recipients and earlier audit rows go too. The "
"account row stays as a tombstone, erased, which every gate keeps denying "
"and which can never be resumed. The erasure's own audit row records the "
"rows removed, the teams deleted, the team environments handed over and "
"the sandbox deletion archive objects left in the bucket, which the "
"control plane may not delete and which follow the bucket's retention "
"policy; the administrator sees the same, archive keys included."
msgstr ""
"随后擦除会删除该账号所有 Agent 数据行，按 catalog 中的外键遍历（先删子表），并且绝不触碰其他 owner 的行：如果其他 "
"owner "
"的行引用了该账号的数据，擦除会被阻止。账号的标识、密码、会话、令牌、验证码、登录事件、邮件收件记录和之前的审计行也会一并删除。账号行作为墓碑保留，标记为已擦除，所有闸门都继续拒绝它，且永远不能恢复。擦除自己的审计行记录删除的行数、删除的团队、移交的团队环境，以及留在存储桶中的沙箱删除归档对象；控制平面无权删除这些对象，它们遵循存储桶的保留策略。管理员看到的内容相同，包括归档"
" key。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:330
msgid ""
"What stays are ids in columns that name a person without owning a row: a "
"deleted team's `owner_user_id` and `created_by_user_id`, team audit "
"events' `actor_user_id` and `target_user_id`, invitations' "
"`created_by_user_id` and join requests' `decided_by_user_id`. They name "
"the erased account, which nothing can sign in as or resolve to a person "
"again."
msgstr ""
"保留下来的是那些指代某个人、但并不拥有某一行的列中的 id：已删除团队的 `owner_user_id` 和 "
"`created_by_user_id`、团队审计事件的 `actor_user_id` 和 `target_user_id`、邀请的 "
"`created_by_user_id`，以及加入请求的 "
"`decided_by_user_id`。它们指向已擦除的账号，任何人都无法再以它登录，也无法再将它对应到某个人。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:336
msgid "Mail to accounts"
msgstr "发送邮件给账号"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:338
msgid ""
"Administrators mail active or suspended accounts chosen by account state "
"and application state, with a ready-made message (maintenance, "
"announcement) or a subject and a Markdown body (raw HTML is not "
"rendered). They preview the recipient count and the message, send it to "
"themselves as a test, then send it now or at a chosen time, confirming "
"the count. A preview belongs to the exact message and audience it showed;"
" any change asks for a new one. The recipients are fixed when it is "
"created, and only verified addresses receive it. A message the selected "
"transport would refuse is refused at preview, test and creation with the "
"reason: Tencent SES sends only approved templates, and a message without "
"its own goes through the notice template, whose variables are limited to "
"800 bytes; SMTP takes any message."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以按账号状态和申请状态，给正常或已停用的账号发送邮件，内容可以是现成模板（维护、公告），也可以是主题加 Markdown 正文（不渲染原始"
" "
"HTML）。他们先预览收件人数量和邮件内容，给自己发一封测试邮件，再立即发送或定时发送，发送前需确认收件人数量。预览只对应它所展示的那份内容和收件范围，任何修改都需要重新预览。收件人在创建时固定，只有已验证的地址会收到。所选传输方式会拒绝的邮件，在预览、测试和创建时就会被拒绝并给出原因：腾讯云"
" SES 只发送已审核的模板，没有专属模板的邮件走通知模板，其变量最多 800 字节；SMTP 接受任何邮件。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:350
msgid ""
"One process at a time sends a message: a claim with its own token, held "
"before every message and taken over once it is 15 minutes old. Each "
"recipient's outcome is recorded as soon as its message is handed over, so"
" a sender that stops resends nothing; one that stalled and resumes after "
"a takeover finds its claim gone and stops. At most the one message in "
"flight when the claim changed hands can arrive twice. An account deleted "
"since is skipped."
msgstr ""
"同一时间只有一个进程发送某封邮件：认领带有自己的令牌，每发一封前都会确认，认领超过 15 "
"分钟即可被接管。每个收件人的结果在其邮件交出后立即记录，因此停止的发送者不会重发任何邮件；停顿后在被接管之后才恢复的发送者会发现认领已被取走并停止。最多只有认领易手时正在发送的那一封可能重复送达。期间被删除的账号会被跳过。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:358
msgid "Stopping an account's work"
msgstr "停止账号的工作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:360
msgid ""
"Revoking, suspending or deleting an account commits the change and opens "
"a termination record (`agent_local_access_terminations`) for the new "
"version in the same transaction. From that commit on, every new owner "
"request, claim, goal round and waiting message reads the denial. "
"Residency establishment and residency heartbeats carry the same condition"
" in their own SQL, so an attempt admitted before the revocation cannot "
"establish or extend a residency afterwards."
msgstr ""
"撤销准入、停用或删除账号时，在同一事务中提交变更，并为新版本创建终止记录（`agent_local_access_terminations`）。从提交完成起，所有新的所有者请求、认领、目标轮次和等待消息都会读取到拒绝决定。residency"
" 建立和心跳也在各自的 SQL 中检查同一条件，因此撤权前已获准的 attempt 不能在撤权后建立或延长 residency。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:368
msgid ""
"`terminate_owner_access` (`application/owner_termination.py`) then stops "
"the work already running, using the paths that already end work safely. "
"It cancels queued turns, asks running turns to stop, pauses waiting "
"messages and active goals, cancels environment tests and prebuilds, stops"
" environment actions, and releases every residency. It closes the "
"released member processes. In each sandbox group whose members all belong"
" to the account, it freezes the group's terminals, kills them and lifts "
"the freeze. Groups shared with another owner's chat are never touched. A "
"terminal that a request admitted before the revocation opens afterwards "
"is killed by that request itself, after it has reopened the termination "
"record, so the next pass kills the terminal if that request cannot."
msgstr ""
"随后，`terminate_owner_access`（`application/owner_termination.py`）使用现有的安全结束流程停止已经运行的工作：取消排队轮次，请求运行中的轮次停止，暂停等待消息和活动目标，取消环境测试与预构建，停止环境操作，并释放所有"
" "
"residency。已释放成员的进程也会被关闭。对于成员全部属于该账号的沙箱组，先冻结该组终端，再终止终端，最后解除冻结。与其他所有者的对话共享的组不会被操作。若撤权前获准的请求在撤权后才打开终端，该请求会先重新开启终止记录，再自行终止新开的终端。这样，即使该请求未能终止终端，下一轮清理也会继续处理。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:380
msgid ""
"The record stays open until a pass finds the terminal cleanup "
"acknowledged and none of the account's turns running. Each reopen "
"increments the record's revision. A pass reads the revision before it "
"starts and closes the record only at that revision, so a terminal "
"reopened while a pass is running keeps the record open for the next pass."
" The background pass checks open records every 30 seconds, up to 50 "
"accounts per pass. A per-account advisory lock serializes passes across "
"processes. Approving the account or granting it administration needs that"
" same lock and no open record, at any revision (otherwise 409 "
"`access_cleanup_pending`), so a delayed pass never stops work that a "
"newer approval allows. Restoring access replays nothing: cancelled turns "
"stay cancelled, and paused goals and queues wait for their owner."
msgstr ""
"只有一轮清理确认终端清理已完成，且该账号没有运行中的轮次，终止记录才会关闭。每次重新开启记录都会递增其修订号。清理开始前先读取修订号，只有记录仍处于该修订号时才能关闭。因此，如果清理期间又有终端被打开，记录便保持开启，交由下一轮清理。后台每"
" 30 秒检查未关闭的记录，每轮最多处理 50 "
"个账号。每个账号使用咨询锁，让不同进程的清理轮次串行执行。批准账号或授予管理权限也必须取得同一把锁，且该账号在任何修订号下都不能有未关闭的终止记录，否则返回"
" 409 "
"`access_cleanup_pending`。因此，延迟执行的清理不会停止后来获批的新工作。恢复准入不会重放任何工作：已取消的轮次保持取消，暂停的目标和队列等待所有者操作。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:393
msgid ""
"No step has a fixed wall-clock deadline. A host that keeps failing, or a "
"backlog of more than one batch of accounts, delays completion. What is "
"fixed is when each kind of work is refused or checked, and that the "
"record stays open, blocking re-approval, until every step is "
"acknowledged."
msgstr "各步骤都没有固定的实际完成时限。主机持续失败，或待处理账号超过一批，都会延迟完成。固定的是各类工作被拒绝或接受检查的时机，以及在所有步骤确认完成之前，终止记录始终保持开启并阻止重新批准。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Work"
msgstr "工作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "When it is refused or checked (default settings)"
msgstr "拒绝或检查的时机（默认设置）"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"New requests, claims, goal rounds, waiting messages, residency "
"establishment and heartbeats"
msgstr "新的请求、认领、目标轮次、等待消息，以及 residency 建立和心跳"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Refused from the commit"
msgstr "从事务提交起拒绝"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Open owner event, change and terminal streams"
msgstr "已打开的所有者事件流、变更流和终端流"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Re-checked every 30 s (`LOCAL_STREAM_RECHECK_S`), between frames"
msgstr "每 30 秒（`LOCAL_STREAM_RECHECK_S`）重新检查一次，在帧与帧之间执行"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "A running turn"
msgstr "运行中的轮次"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Asked to stop by the first pass; it stops at its host's next heartbeat "
"(every 30 s), or when its 120 s attempt lease lapses if the host is "
"silent"
msgstr "首轮清理请求停止；在主机下次心跳时停止，心跳间隔为 30 秒；若主机无响应，则在 120 秒的 attempt 租约到期时停止"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Resident member processes"
msgstr "驻留成员进程"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid ""
"Closed by a pass, or at the host's next residency heartbeat, which no "
"longer extends them"
msgstr "由清理轮次关闭，或在主机下次 residency 心跳时关闭；该心跳不再延长 residency"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Group terminals and environment actions"
msgstr "沙箱组终端与环境操作"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md
msgid "Killed by a pass; retried at each check until the host acknowledges"
msgstr "由清理轮次终止；每次检查都会重试，直到主机确认完成"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:406
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:408
msgid ""
"After approval, an owner opens **My settings → Model connections**, "
"enters a provider's Base URL, API key and model IDs, and chooses **Verify"
" and save**. FreeInference can be used as that provider with the owner's "
"own key. The service checks compatibility before saving; a failed check "
"saves no new connection or replacement key. Only the connection's owner "
"can use it. If the account loses access while verification is in flight, "
"saving rechecks admission under the account lock and refuses the late "
"result without storing a key."
msgstr ""
"获批后，所有者打开**我的设置 → 模型连接**，填写服务商的 Base URL、API key 和模型 "
"ID，点击**验证并保存**。用户可以填写自己的 FreeInference key，将 FreeInference "
"作为服务商。服务会先检查兼容性再保存；检查失败不会新增连接或替换密钥。只有连接所有者可以使用它。如果账号在验证期间失去准入权限，保存事务会持有账号锁重新检查权限，拒绝迟到的结果且不保存密钥。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:416
msgid ""
"Local accounts have no shared model, default provider credential or "
"inference allowance. Inference costs and limits belong to the supplied "
"provider key. Separate Cloud Agent accounts do not create separate "
"provider quotas: keys from the same FreeInference account may still spend"
" that account's shared upstream allowance. Cloud Agent's sandbox and "
"concurrency limits are separate."
msgstr ""
"本地账号没有共享模型、默认服务商凭据或推理额度。费用和限额由所填服务商 key 决定。Cloud Agent "
"账号独立不会产生独立的服务商额度：同一 FreeInference 账号的 key 仍可能共用该上游账号的额度。Cloud Agent "
"的沙箱及并发限制另行管理。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:422
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/agent/config` reports `gateway_inference: false`, an empty "
"Gateway catalog, and the owner's usable connections. Without a usable "
"connection it sets `model_connection_required: true`; the composer links "
"to setup when the feature is enabled and explains when the deployment has"
" disabled it. Gateway model-preference requests answer 409 "
"`model_connection_required`. No local account ID is sent to the Gateway, "
"and no Gateway grant is minted, including for publication titles. Prompt "
"rewriting through the Gateway is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/agent/config` 返回 `gateway_inference: false`、空的 Gateway "
"模型目录，以及所有者可用的连接。没有可用连接时返回 `model_connection_required: "
"true`；功能开启时，输入框提供配置入口，部署关闭功能时则说明原因。Gateway 模型偏好请求返回 409 "
"`model_connection_required`。本地账号 ID 不会发送给 Gateway，也不会签发 Gateway "
"grant，包括发布标题生成。通过 Gateway 改写提示词的功能不可用。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:430
msgid ""
"A task records both the model ID and connection ID. Follow-ups, queued "
"turns, goals, Fork and residency keep that source; an unavailable "
"connection never falls back to a same-named Gateway model or another "
"connection. Saving, disabling or deleting a connection refreshes open "
"composers, which retain an unavailable selection and block submission "
"until the owner chooses a usable source. See [owner model "
"connections](operations.md#owner-model-connections) for verification, key"
" handling and rollout requirements."
msgstr ""
"任务同时记录模型 ID 和连接 ID。续聊、排队轮次、goal、Fork 和常驻进程保留这个来源；连接不可用时，不会回退到同名 Gateway "
"模型或其他连接。保存、停用或删除连接会刷新已打开的输入框；不可用的选择仍保留，直到所有者选择可用来源前都禁止提交。验证、密钥处理及发布要求见[个人模型连接](operations.md"
"#owner-model-connections)。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:438
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Gateway-only per-request usage views (`/admin/agent/runs/{id}/llm-"
"requests`, `/admin/agent/steps`, and an owner's per-message request "
"detail) answer 503 `gateway_feature_unavailable` in local mode, without a"
" Gateway call."
msgstr ""
"仅网关支持的逐请求用量视图（`/admin/agent/runs/{id}/llm-"
"requests`、`/admin/agent/steps`，以及所有者逐条消息的请求明细）在本地模式下返回 503 "
"`gateway_feature_unavailable`，不调用网关。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:442
msgid "Data model"
msgstr "数据模型"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:444
msgid ""
"Migration `0107_local_accounts`, after `0106_user_model_connections`, "
"adds the tables; `0108_local_account_parity` splits sign-in identities "
"from passwords (carrying every account over) and adds the rest. Gateway "
"mode never writes them."
msgstr ""
"迁移 `0107_local_accounts` 接在 `0106_user_model_connections` "
"后面，新增这些表；`0108_local_account_parity` "
