#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:475
msgid ""
"The real-Postgres tier (`make test-db-local`) covers local accounts in "
"six files: `tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_store.py` "
"(races, replay, versions, the reset and suspension barriers, shared "
"counters and the namespace), "
"`tests/integration/servers/test_local_access_termination.py` (stopping "
"work, the residency fence, cleanup barriers and delayed passes), "
"`tests/integration/servers/test_local_accounts_flow.py` (the whole flow "
"over HTTP), "
"`tests/integration/storage/test_independent_accounts_acceptance.py` (the "
"public account lifecycle through the real application with Gateway HTTP "
"forbidden), `tests/integration/storage/test_local_session_reset_race.py` "
"(a login waiting on a password reset cannot open a session with the old "
"password), and "
"`tests/integration/storage/test_local_cleanup_lock_acceptance.py` "
"(cancelling a cleanup lock acquisition before its result arrives releases"
" the lock)."
msgstr ""
"使用真实 Postgres 的测试层（`make test-db-"
"local`）通过六个文件覆盖本地账号：`tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_store.py`"
" "
"覆盖竞态、重放、版本、重置和停用屏障、共享计数器及命名空间；`tests/integration/servers/test_local_access_termination.py`"
" 覆盖停止工作、residency "
"栅栏、清理屏障和延迟清理轮次；`tests/integration/servers/test_local_accounts_flow.py` "
"覆盖完整 HTTP "
"流程；`tests/integration/storage/test_independent_accounts_acceptance.py` "
"在禁止网关 HTTP "
"请求的条件下，使用真实应用覆盖公开账号流程；`tests/integration/storage/test_local_session_reset_race.py`"
" "
"验证等待密码重置完成的登录请求不能用旧密码创建会话；`tests/integration/storage/test_local_cleanup_lock_acceptance.py`"
" 验证申请清理锁的结果尚未返回时取消操作，仍会释放该锁。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:488
msgid ""
"`tests/unit/test_local_account_parity.py`, "
"`tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_parity_store.py` and "
"`tests/integration/servers/test_local_account_parity_flow.py` cover the "
"account features added for HybridInference parity: login names and setup,"
" phone codes and providers, browsers and pinned tabs, password and email "
"changes, deletion, resumption and erasure, the sign-up policy, "
"administration, mail to accounts and the language. "
"`tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_review_store.py` pins the "
"findings of the independent review: proof of a mailbox before the "
"administrator and domain lists trust it, reclaiming an address, host "
"cleanup and teams before erasure, one notice per application, broadcast "
"claims and crash recovery, lock order when signing out everywhere, and "
"audiences. `tests/unit/test_local_account_mail_delivery.py` covers the "
"Tencent SES transport and its size bound. In the web app, "
"`AccountParity.test.tsx`, `AccountCaptcha.test.tsx` (Turnstile on every "
"phone code, one token per request), `AccountAdministration.test.tsx`, "
"`AccountsPageErase.test.tsx` and `AccountLocaleSync.test.tsx` cover the "
"pages with mocked API answers."
msgstr ""
"`tests/unit/test_local_account_parity.py`、`tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_parity_store.py`"
" 和 `tests/integration/servers/test_local_account_parity_flow.py` 覆盖为对齐 "
"HybridInference "
"而新增的账号功能：登录名和首次设置、手机验证码及服务商、浏览器多账号与标签页锁定、修改密码和邮箱、删除、恢复与擦除、注册策略、管理功能、发送邮件给账号以及语言。`tests/integration/storage/test_local_account_review_store.py`"
" "
"固定了独立审查的发现：管理员和域名名单信任某个邮箱之前必须证明邮箱归属、收回地址、擦除前的主机清理和团队处理、每个申请只通知一次、群发认领与崩溃恢复、全部退出时的锁顺序，以及收件范围。`tests/unit/test_local_account_mail_delivery.py`"
" 覆盖腾讯云 SES 传输及其大小限制。在 Web "
"应用中，`AccountParity.test.tsx`、`AccountCaptcha.test.tsx`（每个手机验证码都使用 "
"Turnstile，每个 token "
"只用一次）、`AccountAdministration.test.tsx`、`AccountsPageErase.test.tsx` 和 "
"`AccountLocaleSync.test.tsx` 使用模拟的 API 响应覆盖这些页面。"

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:506
msgid ""
"`tests/integration/servers/test_local_byok_acceptance.py` and "
"`test_local_model_onboarding.py` exercise approval, verified connection "
"setup, task creation, follow-ups, owner isolation, unavailable sources "
"and the explicit feature gate with real accounts and Postgres. They use a"
" fake provider transport and forbid Gateway calls; they are not live-"
"provider or Kata-host acceptance."
msgstr ""
"`tests/integration/servers/test_local_byok_acceptance.py` 和 "
"`test_local_model_onboarding.py` 使用真实账号和 "
"Postgres，覆盖审批、验证并保存连接、创建任务、续聊、所有者隔离、不可用来源及显式功能开关。它们使用模拟服务商传输层，并禁止 Gateway"
" 调用；这不等于真实服务商或 Kata 主机验收。"

